@name     notes_to_data
@alias    n>d
@group    sys
@c_name   skode_clause_notes_to_data
@type     immediate
@arity    0
@match    ()
@summary  parse musical note string into data array
@doc
Parses note name string (e.g. [C4 E4 G4]) and writes MIDI note numbers to data buffer.
Usage: [notes] n>d
@code
    return skode_exec_n_gtd(ctx, s, args, argc);
@end
